              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, MUKAMA ngugwo naaruga omu kikaali kye, naija kufubira abaikara omunsi habw'ebibi ebi baakozire, ensi niija kwoleka esagama eyaseesirweho kandi terigaruka kuswekerra abafu.",
          "type": "text",
